---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { content } from '../data/content';

const data = content.en;
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Portfolio | ${data.title}`}
  description="Selected Modus Data case studies in AI, data engineering and enterprise integration."
>
  <section class="hero-panel portfolio-intro">
    <h1>Portfolio</h1>
    <p>With over 10 years of experience in the data space, our company has solved complex challenges across AI, data engineering and enterprise integration. Here, we present selected problems we have resolved that may be relevant to other organizations.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="portfolio-grid" aria-label="Case studies">
    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image portfolio-card-image-self-hosted-llms" href="/portfolio/self-hosted-llms/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_self_hosted_llms/PPAI%20hero.png" alt="Private AI architecture with secure enterprise deployment of self-hosted LLMs" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Enterprise AI · Data privacy · Self-hosted LLMs</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/self-hosted-llms/">Private AI: Self-Hosted LLMs in Your Own Cloud</a></h2>
        <p>We design and deploy self-hosted open-weight LLMs in your own Azure or GCP tenant, with private networking, audit logging and enterprise identity controls.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/self-hosted-llms/">Read more <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image" href="/portfolio/multi-modal-omics-radiomics-pipelines/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_omics_radiomics/omics-radiomics-hero.jpg" alt="Multi-modal fusion of radiomics, genomics and AI pipelines" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Healthcare AI · Radiomics · RWE</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/multi-modal-omics-radiomics-pipelines/">From Omics Data to Predictive RWE Models</a></h2>
        <p>How reproducible radiomics, multi-omics and federated learning pipelines turn complex medical data into validated insights.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/multi-modal-omics-radiomics-pipelines/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image" href="/portfolio/master-data-reconciliation/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_sap_sf_linker/post_img1.jpeg" alt="Automated data reconciliation pipeline architecture" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Data engineering · M&A integration</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/master-data-reconciliation/">Solving the Post-M&A Master Data Bottleneck</a></h2>
        <p>How a deterministic and AI-assisted entity resolution pipeline harmonizes SAP, Dynamics and Salesforce customer data.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/master-data-reconciliation/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image" href="/portfolio/federated-learning/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_federated_learning/federated_learning_image.jpeg" alt="Federated learning architecture across medical centers" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Healthcare AI · Privacy-preserving ML</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/federated-learning/">Breaking Data Silos in Pharma</a></h2>
        <p>How federated learning enables multi-center real-world evidence without moving raw patient data.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/federated-learning/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image" href="/portfolio/enterprise-fraud-detection/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_fraud_detection/fraud-detection-hero.png" alt="Real-time enterprise fraud detection network" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Fraud detection · Machine learning · Risk architecture</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/enterprise-fraud-detection/">From Real-Time Fraud Detection to Bottom-Line ROI</a></h2>
        <p>How streaming machine learning, graph analytics and financial utility metrics protect revenue without adding friction for legitimate customers.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/enterprise-fraud-detection/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image" href="/portfolio/agentic-ai-insurance/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_agentic_insurance/agentic-insurance-hero.png" alt="Agentic AI workflow for insurance claims processing" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Agentic AI · Insurance · Claims automation</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/agentic-ai-insurance/">Agentic AI for Compliant Claims Processing</a></h2>
        <p>How LangGraph, retrieval-augmented workflows and human oversight turn complex claims into transparent, auditable decisions.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/agentic-ai-insurance/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image" href="/portfolio/databricks-data-engineering/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_databricks/databricks-data-engineering-hero.png" alt="Enterprise data engineering flow from Azure Data Factory through Databricks to Power BI" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Data engineering · Databricks · Azure</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/databricks-data-engineering/">Optimizing Enterprise Workloads on Databricks</a></h2>
        <p>How an orchestrated medallion architecture turns heterogeneous structured and unstructured data into a governed source of truth for Power BI.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/databricks-data-engineering/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image portfolio-card-image-sales-intelligence" href="/portfolio/predictive-sales-intelligence/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_sales_intelligence/sales-intelligence-hero.jpg" alt="Sales intelligence connecting market signals, account data and client retention" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Sales intelligence · Churn prevention · Machine learning</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/predictive-sales-intelligence/">Predictive Sales Intelligence and Churn Mitigation</a></h2>
        <p>How external market signals and internal account data help revenue teams identify growth opportunities and act earlier on churn risk.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/predictive-sales-intelligence/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="portfolio-card">
      <a class="portfolio-card-image" href="/portfolio/sap-ai-ticket-categorization/">
        <img src="/img/assets/post_sap_ai_ticketing/hero%20sap%20azure.jpeg" alt="Decoupled SAP and Azure AI architecture for support ticket categorization" />
      </a>
      <div class="portfolio-card-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">Enterprise AI · SAP · Azure architecture</p>
        <h2><a href="/portfolio/sap-ai-ticket-categorization/">A hybrid BTP/Azure architecture for agentic AI integration into SAP</a></h2>
        <p>How a Clean Core architecture combines SAP BTP, Azure Container Apps and LangGraph to categorize complex support tickets.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="/portfolio/sap-ai-ticket-categorization/">Read the case study <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
